*Hendrik is mentioned in [[Dirk]] and [[Daan]]'s dialogue, which are the same.
*{{NPC|Gary}}, '''Hendrik''', {{NPC|Sherry}} and {{NPC|St. Jerry}}  can not be given a {{Item|Bachelor's Rose}} during [[Jerry's Workshop]] if the [[Defend Jerry's Workshop]] event is not active.

